Rule 4 (string norm_type selects the infinity norm)
{v_3 : str} |= v_3 = "max"
>>
Rule 5 (if error_if_nonfinite is true, enforce a positive max_norm)
{v_2 : float ⊎ int, v_4 : bool} |= if v_4 then v_2 > 0
>>
Rule 6 (foreach flag is explicitly boolean)
{v_5 : bool} |= v_5 = true ∨ v_5 = false
